# Generated by support/export-artifacts.py; do not edit.
# slug: ch55-widen
# source: chapters/ch55.tex:199
# label: alg:ch55-widen
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch55.tex:202
# caption: Find a valid layout by monotonically widening instruction forms.

REQUIRE finite ordered forms per instruction, largest forms checked for representability
ENSURE a self-consistent valid layout or explicit unrepresentable-reference error
choose the smallest allowed form for each relaxable instruction
REPEAT
  recompute offsets, labels, and alignment padding from current forms
  collect instructions whose fields do not fit in the current layout
  IF any failing instruction has no wider supported form THEN
    RETURN unrepresentable-reference error
  END IF
  widen every collected instruction by at least one form
UNTIL no instruction was widened
revalidate every final field, then emit bytes and relocations

